Subject: apps/speed: Omit unavailable algorithms in FIPS mode

Forwarded: no
Applied-Upstream: no
Bug-Ubuntu: https://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/openssl/+bug/2056593
---
 apps/speed.c | 66 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 66 insertions(+)

--- a/apps/speed.c
